 "strings": [
  "",
  "While Kamille and Amuro",
  "kept skirmishing with the Sudori",
  "down on Earth,",
  "Jamitov had hardly",
  "been sitting idle.",
  "He took A Baoa Qu, a resource",
  "satellite for colony redevelopment",
  "under Federation Forces control,",
  "moved it into the space around",
  "Gryps, and made it the fortress",
  "known as the \"Gate of Zedan.\"",
  "Jamitov",
  "\"A base on the moon's far side is",
  " no grounds for coercing the",
  " Earth Federation government.\"",
  "\"That, it seems, is something",
  " the space colonists can't grasp.\"",
  "Officer",
  "\"The Dogosse Giar seems",
  " to have found this ship, sir.\"",
  "\"...Heh heh heh...",
  " Well done, finding",
  " this ship...\"",
  "The new battleship Dogosse Giar",
  "was derived from the Birmingham.",
  "It was a scaled-up version",
  "of the old White Base,",
  "combining mobility",
  "with the means to operate",
  "mobile suits; it might best",
  "be called a flying battleship.",
  "The number of MS it could carry",
  "alone was extraordinary,",
  "and its fighting power",
  "rivaled that of a small fortress.",
  "Kamille's mother played",
  "a large part in designing",
  "this ship, a fact",
  "that can only be called",
  "one of history's ironies.",
  "Each of the three Bidans",
  "made no small contribution",
  "to the course of the war in 0087.",
  "Built in secret, hidden even from",
  "the Federation government,",
  "the Dogosse Giar was given",
  "to Paptimus Scirocco, back from",
  "Jupiter, by Jamitov himself.",
  "He believed that the age of Bask,",
  "a warmonger hardened in his",
  "hatred of the people of space,",
  "had come to an end.",
  "On the road to taking power,",
  "Bask-style terror was needed;",
  "after that, though, he was a man",
  "who would only alienate the public.",
  "As a counterweight",
  "to Bask,",
  "the young man Scirocco,",
  "newly back from Jupiter,",
  "was ideal.",
  "Above all,",
  "the Titans were no longer made up",
  "of Earth's people alone.",
  "In absorbing the regular army,",
  "they had taken in great numbers",
  "of space colonists.",
  "Showing them that even one",
  "born in space could rise",
  "to the inner circle",
  "would mean something, he thought.",
  "Meanwhile...",
  "Torres",
  "\"This is Center Back.\"",
  "\"Forward 2,",
  " score or no score,",
  " return to the goal.\"",
  "AEUG Soldier",
  "\"This is Forward 2. Roger.\"",
  "Bright",
  "\"Two days now",
  " since the Titans fleet",
  " left Gryps...\"",
  "\"And we still don't even know",
  " what course",
  " they're on...\"",
  "Emma",
  "\"Captain.",
  " ...Forward 4 couldn't track",
  " any enemy movement.\"",
  "\"Good work...\"",
  "\"Which means",
  " their target doesn't look",
  " like Side 2, then?\"",
  "\"The moon... I'm sure of it.\"",
  "\"Granada?\"",
  "\"But don't you think",
  " the fleet that left Gryps",
  " is rather small?\"",
  "\"No,",
  " they'll join up somewhere.\"",
  "\"We just haven't found",
  " those forces yet.\"",
  "Kamille",
  "\"Kamille Bidan,",
  " returning.\"",
  "\"...The transport you checked?\"",
  "\"It was the Colony Corporation's.",
  " It wasn't disguised.\"",
  "\"They let me",
  " look at the cargo...\"",
  "\"Good work.\"",
  "\"Yes, ma'am!\"",
  "\"If we can't pin down that fleet,",
  " we won't know where to deploy",
  " the AEUG's ships.\"",
  "\"Couldn't they be heading",
  " for the moon's near side?\"",
  "Quite apart from",
  "these grown-up deliberations,",
  "Kamille",
  "was busy quarreling",
  "with Torres, the operator.",
  "\"What's your problem!\"",
  "\"Shut up! You're so annoying!\"",
  "\"You're the weird one,",
  " flying a mobile suit",
  " with your head in the clouds.\"",
  "There was no particular reason.",
  "The AEUG, more than an army,",
  "always had a strong",
  "family feel to it,",
  "so such things happen--",
  "let us note that and no more.",
  "But Emma Sheen, who considered",
  "herself a big sister to Kamille,",
  "fussed over him.",
  "She was a good soul.",
  "At the very least, she appealed",
  "to men dozens of times more",
  "than she herself ever imagined.",
  "That was especially so of Henken",
  "Bekkener, captain of the Radish,",
  "the Argama's consort ship.",
  "\"You did well on Earth,",
  " and it gave you confidence,",
  " but space is different.\"",
  "\"I don't think I've gotten",
