  "which Scirocco had brought",
  "back from Jupiter.",
  "Its movable frame,",
  "in the line of the Gundam Mk-II,",
  "had a system that could switch",
  "from mobile armor",
  "to mobile suit in an instant,",
  "and on top of that",
  "it boasted firepower far beyond",
  "anything the Marasai or Hizack",
  "could bring to bear.",
  "That Scirocco, who had designed",
  "this machine and sold it,",
  "was no ordinary man",
