  "and being chosen",
  "as the dedicated test pilot",
  "to fly it",
  "tickled Jerid's pride",
  "immensely.",
  "Mouar Pharaoh was",
  "a grown woman who called to mind",
  "the late Lila.",
  "Since she had seen promise in him,",
  "Jerid was in the grip of",
  "a young man's hunger",
  "to make his mark in battle.",
  "Jerid",
  "\"Hahaha! What power!",
  " With this, I can take down",
  " the Gundam Mk-II in one shot!\"",
  "Mouar",
  "\"Testing the transformation!\"",
  "\"Roger, Mouar! Me too...!\"",
  "\"Not bad at all!",
  " This Gabthley.\"",
  "\"I don't know",
  " what Scirocco's up to,",
  " but I'll show him!\"",
  "\"This man Scirocco...\"",
  "\"Why he'd name Mouar and me",
  " for transfer to his mobile suit",
  " unit, I can't figure out.\"",
  "\"Play around like that",
  " and you'll get shot down.\"",
  "\"Is that Scirocco's",
  " Messala...!?\"",
  "\"Lieutenant Scirocco!",
  " Thank you for issuing us",
  " such a fine mobile suit.\"",
  "\"We're grateful.\"",
  "\"Fine skill.",
  " You're all I expected.\"",
  "\"I'd be pleased if you put",
  " that skill to work for me,",
  " Mouar.\"",
  "(Damn you, Scirocco...",
  " did you call Mouar here",
  " meaning to make her your woman?)",
  "It was jealousy.",
  "But more than that,",
  "Jerid's instincts told him",
  "that a man like Scirocco,",
  "who needlessly brought",
  "romance onto the battlefield,",
  "could not be trusted.",
  "This was a man who used",
  "his Messala to hold",
  "Mouar's Gabthley as if",
  "embracing her from behind.",
  "To Jerid, that hardly",
  "seemed like sane behavior.",
  "\"Forgive me, but I must ask.",
  " Lieutenant Scirocco,",
  " what is it you're after...?\"",
  "\"The reason you want",
  " to know what I'm thinking\"",
  "\"is that Mouar Pharaoh",
  " is in a good position.\"",
  "\"A good position?\"",
  "\"Yes. In a common man's place,",
  " you might fear me, but\"",
  "\"you'd never think to ask me",
  " such a thing to my face.\"",
  "\"I have great respect",
  " for you, Lieutenant Scirocco.\"",
  "\"I know that, too.\"",
  "\"I believe my mission",
  " is to free those whose souls",
  " are weighed down by gravity.\"",
  "\"But that's... the AEUG's goal.\"",
  "\"Not so.",
  " For all their clamor about space,",
