  "\"......\"",
  "\"Not satisfied, Jerid-kun?\"",
  "\"Are you saying you're",
  " a Newtype yourself, sir?\"",
  "\"I merely sense",
  " that without me,",
  " the times will not change...\"",
  "\"Jamitov, in order",
  " to wipe out the people",
  " held fast by the Earth,\"",
  "\"turned the Earth Federation",
  " Forces into the Titans.\"",
  "\"What...?\"",
  "\"Start a war, drive the economy",
  " of Earth into utter ruin,\"",
  "\"and the people on Earth",
  " will starve and be gone.\"",
  "\"But then,",
  " on the surface, it looks the same",
