  "\"...And that's you?\"",
  "\"Hardly...",
  " The one who rules postwar Earth",
  " will be a woman.\"",
  "\"A woman like",
  " Mouar Pharaoh. Once I see that,",
  " I'll set off to travel the stars.\"",
  "With a look that left",
  "no telling how serious he was,",
  "Scirocco took his leave",
