  "\"Nodding along like that--",
  " what was that about?\"",
  "\"Just humoring him.\"",
  "\"Don't betray the hunch that made",
  " me save you at Jaburo, okay?\"",
  "\"I know!\"",
  "Jamitov Hymem",
  "was a man of righteousness.",
  "Righteousness means",
  "curbing desire, scorning evil,",
  "and doing what is right.",
  "His aim was to overthrow",
  "the corrupt Earth Federation.",
  "He drifted from officer school to",
  "economics; by the One Year War he",
  "had slipped back to General Staff.",
  "It was fair to say he knew",
  "every hidden corner",
  "of the Earth Sphere.",
  "Over half a lifetime, Jamitov had",
  "watched political hacks wreck the",
  "Universal Century's ideals.",
  "Space emigration, meant to",
  "revive Earth, was used to keep",
  "the privileged class in place.",
  "\"Set up a dictatorship to topple it.",
  " Gihren had the right idea.",
  " But his methods were wrong.\"",
  "So Jamitov thought.",
  "For that dictatorship",
  "had veered off in a direction",
  "far from the ideal, driven, frankly,",
  "by personal greed.",
  "And so, Jamitov,",
  "before making his move,",
  "cut every tie to his family.",
  "With no fortune for any heirs,",
  "greed could never sway his cause.",
  "All that remained was to exploit",
  "Delaz's uprising, to manipulate",
  "fickle fools like Bask, who seethed",
  "with hatred of Zeon, and to take",
  "power legally, working parliament",
  "with the Titans' arms behind him.",
  "After that, he need only twist",
  "Earth supremacism and force all",
  "mankind to emigrate into space.",
  "Melanie Hue Carbine had been his",
  "classmate at officer school,",
  "and his methods must have seemed",
  "hopelessly soft",
  "to a man like Jamitov.",
  "He never sought",
  "anyone's understanding,",
  "and almost never even explained",
  "what he intended.",
  "Justice that wavers is no justice.",
  "\"Paptimus Scirocco...",
  " just what is he after?\"",
  "\"Meaning, sir?\"",
  "\"Scirocco is no mere",
  " transport ship captain.\"",
  "\"You saw his",
  " transformable mobile suit.\"",
  "\"It was magnificent.\"",
  "\"That's right.",
  " He didn't waste the time",
  " of his round trip to Jupiter.\"",
  "\"And he can live",
  " like a hermit",
  " at that young age.\"",
  "\"There's bound to be a backlash.\"",
  "\"Ah... a slave to ambition?\"",
  "\"Of the Newtype kind...",
  " He may be dangerous...\"",
  "\"Surely not... An oath of loyalty",
  " to Your Excellency, in blood.",
  " Scirocco's own idea, sir...\"",
  "\"Ah... hahaha... Show me...\"",
  "\"Here, this is it.\"",
  "\"...I vow fealty to Your Excellency;",
  " if I break faith, my life is yours.",
  " Paptimus Scirocco\"",
  "Yet just how Jamitov",
  "came to place",
  "such heavy reliance",
  "on a man like Scirocco",
  "is a process that",
  "remains unclear.",
  "It is true that Scirocco,",
  "back from Jupiter,",
  "sold himself to the Titans,",
  "but that alone",
  "cannot explain",
  "his bond with Jamitov.",
  "According to one theory,",
  "Scirocco had deep ties",
  "to a secret society of sorts",
  "that stood",
  "behind Jamitov.",
  "The two, seemingly unrelated,",
  "were linked beneath the surface,",
  "and Scirocco had been, all along,",
  "a Cyber-Newtype created",
  "by Jamitov:",
  "a being whose deep and surface",
  "minds were fused, or so it is said.",
  "Most likely, however,",
  "this was simply something",
  "a press suspicious",
  "of the relationship",
  "cooked up for entertainment,",
  "and should be treated as such.",
  "The truth was that Jamitov",
  "had grown utterly weary",
  "of Bask's",
  "machismo.",
  "At any rate, the Argama made",
  "contact with the Dogosse Giar.",
  "The fight had no strategic value;",
  "both sides were probing in force.",
  "Each side's urge to skirmish",
  "and gauge the other's response",
  "touched off a local battle.",
  "\"Words come easy,",
  " don't they, Scirocco-san?\"",
  "\"Once the war's over,",
  " you plan to have it good",
  " all by yourself, right?\"",
  "\"To me, you're just one more",
  " enemy to kick out of the way!",
  " ...Hm?\"",
  "\"Heh... Luck's on my side.",
  " ...I believe that luck",
  " is part of skill.\"",
  "Bridge Crew",
  "\"Jerid's unit has a target!\"",
  "\"Send Mouar out in support.",
  " We may launch",
  " more units after her!\"",
  "\"Mouar's unit",
  " moving to the catapult deck.\"",
  "\"Well, fine...",
  " The point is to see what",
  " the two Gabthleys can do...\"",
  "\"Close in on the combat zone,",
  " but stay out of danger!\"",
  "The Argama was quick to move, too.",
  "No longer the motley outfit",
  "it once was, the Argama,",
  "having fought the Titans time",
  "and again since atmospheric entry,",
  "now",
  "functioned as",
  "a battle-hardened unit.",
  "Apolly",
  "\"The enemy's cleared off!\"",
  "\"Hey, Kamille,",
  " something fun happened",
  " in New Hong Kong, right?\"",
  "\"Nothing happened!\"",
  "\"Ever since I came up here,",
  " it's been 'Earth-addled' this,\"",
  "\"and Lieutenant Emma's done",
  " nothing but",
  " chew me out!\"",
  "\"How could that",
  " be fun?\"",
  "\"Don't get sore!",
  " To make up for it, I'll let",
  " you fly this machine.\"",
  "\"You fought at Jaburo,",
  " then made it from the Audhumla",
  " to the Argama.\"",
  "\"I'd say you've earned it.",
  " Ensign Reccoa agrees.\"",
  "Reccoa",
  "\"Kamille,",
  " recover the Mk-II and",
  " return to the Argama. All right?\"",
  "\"Roger, Reccoa-san.\"",
  "\"Thanks to you too, Fa.\"",
  "Fa",
  "\"Fighting's all we can do now,",
  " so I have to do it too.\"",
  "\"I know.\"",
  "\"Do you?\"",
  "\"Yeah...\"",
  "\"What?\"",
  "\"Like this,",
  " ...we can't kiss.\"",
  "\"Oh, right... Mm...",
  " No, stop...",
  " Ahahahaha...\"",
  "\"Come on... Fa!\""
